Error [jet.DispatchMissingComparison]: A multi-arm `if` needs a comparison between the subject and `{`
  --> tests/ui/e0992_multi_arm_if_needs_comparison.jet:4:5
    |
  4 |     if count {
    |     ^^
 Why: `if subject == { … }` (or `<`, `>`, `!=`, `<=`, `>=`) marks value dispatch explicitly, so a plain `if cond { … }` body is always statements
 Fix: Write `if subject == { value -> body }`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0992
